WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.980
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.000
I will defeat you someday!

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.420
But the Knights of Hanoi 
are destroying LINK VRAINS!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.120
I'll crush them first!

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.430
What about you, Blue Angel?

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.000
Even if it loses, a 100% AI 
can't be turned into Another.

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:27.310
But that's not the same for you.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.520
What's going on?

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:36.730
Two Knights of Hanoi are 
winning at incredible speed!

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:37.900
Two?

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.250
I'll put it on screen!

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:43.350
Them?

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:46.460
The AI Squad have all lost.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.960
You're going to work now?

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:49.830
Yeah.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:56.570
I doubt I can do anything, but I'm going.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.230
Bye.

00:01:04.420 --> 00:01:05.640
I...

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:24.410
I run Across the universe

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:27.830
At the speed of light

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:29.550
Begin Loading

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:33.350
Open the door of dreams

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:36.850
VRAINS spreads

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:39.960
Believe in myself

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:43.380
VRAINS continues

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:48.830
The circuit draws the future

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:52.940
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.300
Access!

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:57.210
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:58.710
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:00.940
Link with my soul

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:03.740
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:05.450
Now Win the Race

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:08.450
Connected world

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:11.920
No matter when

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:15.150
Nothing is impossible

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:19.380
Strive for hope

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:24.070
And ride the wind!

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:43.770
Party time!

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:48.800
The internet is bashing 
the new Security Manager!

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:51.380
Oh my!  They're so harsh!

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:52.580
It's incredible!

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:55.710
Because he lost after bragging about it.

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:59.570
Tons of harsh postings 
about SOL Technologies.

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:02.560
"Hold another press 
conference and apologize!"

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:04.570
Or "Fire who's responsible!"

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:07.470
Be quiet!  You're interfering with work!

00:03:08.590 --> 00:03:09.660
Okay.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:15.470
If LINK VRAINS falls into Hanoi's hands, 
they'll come after Playmaker full force.

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:17.740
That would be trouble.

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:22.210
Things may change if we 
find the Anothers' origin.

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:27.190
But for now, let's get info from the victims.

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:33.560
Well done, Baira.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:37.790
Now SOL Technologies will 
remain quiet for a while.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:41.500
Are you fine with this?

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:46.180
If Dr. Kogami's plan is implemented...

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:49.940
...it'll be the biggest 
cyber crime in history.

00:03:49.940 --> 00:03:56.580
That means Revolver, as the leader of the 
Knights of Hanoi, will commit a historical crime.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.550
You're fine with that?

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:03.290
Because you think of Revolver 
as your younger brother.

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:07.710
As the mastermind behind the Anothers...

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:10.580
...I'd be lying if I said 
I didn't feel guilt.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:16.000
But he'll be feeling guilt that's 
hundreds of times bigger!

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:21.470
To stop Dr. Kogami's plan 
before it's executed...

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:26.940
...we must defeat Playmaker, acquire the 
Ignis and find the Cyberse World first.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:33.070
That's why we needed Anothers 
as a way to capture Playmaker.

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:35.390
Don't blame yourself too much.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:38.890
Okay.  Thank you, Faust.

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:45.100
If Playmaker is searching for the removal 
program, he may eventually come to you.

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.340
That would be convenient.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:49.560
I'll finish him.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.290
I will acquire the Ignis!

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:57.990
Wake up, Yusaku.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.670
You'll be late for school.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.250
I'll handle the rest.

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:06.720
I'll pass the baton after school.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:24.800
He's mine.

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:30.680
Duel me.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.790
Okay.  Thanks!

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.010
What?

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.730
Go Onizuka!

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:42.720
I'll take you on!

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:44.410
Entertain me.

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:46.690
Speed Duel!

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:51.160
Following in Playmaker's footsteps...

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:56.030
...Go Onizuka is also battling against the 
Knights of Hanoi to protect LINK VRAINS.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:03.580
They're the only two we can rely 
on.  I hope they do their best.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:07.580
No, there's one more!  Blue Angel!

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:10.320
But she hasn't shown up recently.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:15.500
Her fans must be anxiously 
waiting for her to show up!

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:21.420
Why won't Blue Angel show up?

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:23.220
Maybe she's scared.

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:28.370
Now's when I want her to show up 
and fight the Knights of Hanoi!

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:37.610
You're Aoi Zaizen, right?

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:40.350
I want to talk to you.

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.450
Come with me?

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:49.050
"I know you're there, Blue Angel."

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:59.110
You're Ghost Girl.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:03.400
Talk about what?

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:06.400
Are you done being Blue Angel?

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.920
That again...

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:10.800
Many people are waiting for you.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.880
That's an exaggeration.

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:16.840
I don't fight for other people.

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:18.980
I fight for myself!

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.470
That's right.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:26.690
You became Blue Angel so that your 
brother would appreciate you.

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:31.200
But now that you know 
your brother loves you...

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:33.160
...you don't need her anymore.

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:34.990
Is that wrong?

00:07:34.990 --> 00:07:37.400
Actually, I think that's good.

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:43.880
It's better than losing because 
you're not fully committed.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:48.350
If you can't take responsibility 
for your actions...

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:51.080
...you should stop being Blue Angel.

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:56.190
And only do things that make you happy.

00:07:56.690 --> 00:08:02.290
Then you won't get others in trouble.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:05.560
Glad to find out how you really feel.

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:09.030
Bye, Blue Angel.

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:11.460
No, I mean Aoi Zaizen.

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:24.780
Sheesh.  Why do I do this?

00:08:30.370 --> 00:08:31.970
Welcome back.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:33.490
Learn anything?

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:37.000
Nothing at all.  Not even a trace.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:42.500
Oh?  Is the great Kusanagi giving up?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.240
I'm only getting started, idiot.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:48.040
“Idiot” is a forbidden word!

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.440
Kusanagi, go to bed.

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:51.280
I'll do the rest.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:52.740
Thanks.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:55.450
But I'll cook something first.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:56.650
You're hungry, right?

00:08:56.960 --> 00:09:00.390
But there are only hot dogs and chili dogs!

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:04.360
That's not true.  There are 
also cheese dogs and fries!

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:06.500
I'm home.

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:13.540
What's with her?  Suddenly 
showing up and lecturing me?

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:26.170
Huh?  Where did Yamamoto go?

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:27.860
Hey!

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:31.550
We're done for today!  We're leaving!

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:34.250
What?  But we just got here!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.760
Orders from the higher-ups.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:41.750
No broadcasts from LINK VRAINS for now.

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:43.400
Why?

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:50.770
The broadcasts have incited young people 
to come to LINK VRAINS, despite the danger.

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:55.220
The broadcasts incited them?  
That's a false accusation!

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:58.830
Boss, you're gonna leave without a fight?

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:01.580
You fool!  You don't know what's up!

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:05.160
Boss, I...

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.480
I misjudged you!

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:09.590
What!

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:12.590
Boss, look!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:14.560
What is it?

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:20.770
She's here!

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.130
Aren't you...

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:27.240
One of the two Knights of Hanoi 
who defeated the AI Squad!

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:30.310
You're journalists, right?

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:33.210
Do you know where Playmaker is?

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:35.840
We don't we don't we don't!

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:38.950
Oh?  But you're always following him around.

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:43.420
It's for your own good to tell me now.

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:46.240
We don't know anything!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:50.400
Boss, we're goners before 
we get our TV special?

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:55.500
Huh?  You really don't know?

00:10:56.890 --> 00:11:00.760
Then if you see him, bring him to me.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:03.550
I'll end him in a duel.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:04.880
Wait right there!

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.950
Blue Angel!

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:13.460
Duel me first!

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.240
Blue Angel...

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:23.770
I'm in a super bad mood.

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:27.330
I feel like beating someone, no matter who.

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:30.300
And you just happen to be unlucky.

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:34.270
I thought you wouldn't come here anymore.

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:38.880
What?  You're going to lecture me too?

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:44.450
You know more than anyone how 
scary computer viruses are.

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:48.130
But you came here to get infected again.

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:51.620
Who said I was going to lose?

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:58.100
And I want to forget that 
incident, so stop reminding me!

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:00.840
Then I'll tell you this.

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:04.850
You were the computer 
virus's first test subject.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:12.540
We improved the data we got from you 
to create the Another computer virus.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:16.980
You sound like you created it.

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:18.720
Is that true?

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:21.950
What if I say yes?

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:24.190
I won't forgive you!

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:27.660
I take back saying I didn't 
care who my opponent was.

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:30.660
I will beat you!

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:34.330
I'll pay you back many times over!

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:36.470
Okay.

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:40.100
I'll take responsibility for what I did.

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.840
I hate those words.

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:45.840
C'mon!  Hurry up and film it!

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:48.750
Huh?  But the higher-ups told us to leave.

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:51.980
It's a battle between Blue 
Angel and Hanoi's ace!

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:53.320
Just film it!

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:56.550
I'll take responsibility!

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:59.890
Boss!  I was waiting for you to say that!

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:02.740
That's why I admire you, Yamamoto-

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:05.980
Don't call me by my real 
name!  Hurry up and film!

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:07.130
Okay!

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:20.880
Whoa!  It's Blue Angel!

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:26.200
She hadn't shown up recently, 
so rumors said she retired.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:27.790
But she's back!

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:31.040
I'm leaving.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:35.290
Blue Angel has returned to LINK VRAINS!

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:38.360
Excuse me, but can I look?

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.230
Of course!

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:44.700
To all my fans, sorry to keep you waiting!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:49.870
She's your sister, right?

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:51.910
She's incredible!

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:56.000
I'll cheer her on!

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.950
Hooray!  Hooray!  Go for it!

00:13:57.950 --> 00:13:59.120
Aoi...

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:02.850
Don't go to LINK VRAINS.  I'm serious.

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:05.900
Yes, brother.

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:09.790
Why is she doing this?

00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:14.230
We're counting on you, Blue Angel!

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:19.470
Defeat the Knights of Hanoi who are 
threatening the peace in LINK VRAINS!

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:25.810
I'll prepare a special 
stage fitting for an idol.

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:29.480
Activate Data Gale!

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:40.650
The Data Storm is...

00:14:42.890 --> 00:14:44.030
Huh?

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:50.600
Good luck, Blue Angel!

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:57.740
Speed Duel!

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:03.120
I'll go first!  My turn!

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:07.690
From my hand, I activate the Field 
Spell, Trickstar Light Stage!

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:12.220
I add one Trickstar monster 
from my deck to my hand.

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:17.120
When this card is added to my 
hand other than by a draw,

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:19.600
I can Special Summon Trickstar Lilybell!

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:29.040
Then I summon Trickstar 
Nightshade from my hand!

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:36.180
It's been a while that I'm going all out!

00:15:36.500 --> 00:15:39.970
Come out, the circuit of dreams and hope!

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:45.460
The summoning conditions are two Trickstars!

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:50.430
I set Lilybell and Nightshade 
in the Link Markers!

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.300
Link Summon!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:56.770
Appear, Link 2 Trickstar Holly Angel!

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:07.600
Whoa!  Blue Angel already Link Summoned!

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:13.820
When Trickstar Nightshade 
is used to Link Summon...

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:17.060
...she Special Summons 
herself from the graveyard!

00:16:20.400 --> 00:16:24.360
Now Trickstar Holly Angel's effect!

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:29.330
When a Trickstar is summoned or 
Special Summoned next to her link...

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.780
...you take 200 damage!

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:43.210
And when my Trickstar deals 
you battle or effect damage...

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:49.100
...my Field Spell Trickstar Light 
Stage's effect deals you 200 damage!

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:59.250
I was screaming from the bottomless 
darkness during that incident.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:07.160
While I felt like I was going to be crushed 
by heavy sadness, fear and despair...

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:08.810
...I kept screaming with all my might.

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:13.700
A sorrowful scream that no one could hear.

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:19.230
Many people who've been turned into 
Anothers are enduring the same pain.

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:22.790
I'll never forgive you!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:26.780
I set one card and end my turn!

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:29.960
You're up!

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:34.050
I'll show you why I love Trickstars 
until it makes you sick!

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:38.670
You don't know anything.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:44.010
Your deck is too popular now.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:47.680
You think I didn't have a counterstrategy?

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:50.860
Here I go.

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.920
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:54.830 --> 00:18:00.370
You'll learn why I have an 
overwhelming advantage over you!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:06.660
When there's a Field Spell, I can Special 
Summon Dark Mummy Probe from my hand!

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:14.010
Next, a Field Spell is destroyed.

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:15.810
What?  No way!

00:18:17.340 --> 00:18:20.180
Then I summon Dark Mummy Probe!

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:25.740
I set one card.

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:29.990
I activate the Continuous 
Spell, Temple of the Kings!

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:34.540
Once per turn, I can activate a 
trap card that was set that turn.

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:39.130
I activate the trap card, 
Current Corruption Virus!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:40.570
A Virus Deck!

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:45.260
I tribute a Dark monster 
with 0 DEF on my field.

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:52.780
For three turns, your monsters with 2000 
or fewer DEF have their effects negated...

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:54.710
...and their ATK becomes 0.

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:07.220
But since Link Monsters don't 
have DEF, they're not affected!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.730
I'm only getting started.

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:18.270
I tribute one Dark Mummy to activate 
the spell card, Monster Restitch.

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:23.200
I Special Summon three Dark 
Mummy Tokens on my field.

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:29.450
Three monsters...  She's 
going to Link Summon!

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:36.810
Appear!  Our future circuit!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:42.880
The summoning conditions 
are three Dark Mummies.

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:47.270
I set three Dark Mummy 
Tokens in the Link Markers.

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:50.230
Link Summon!

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:53.160
Appear, Link 3!

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:58.300
Dark Mummy Surgical Forceps!

00:20:00.520 --> 00:20:03.610
That looks eerie.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:11.060
Battle!  Dark Mummy Surgical Forceps 
attacks Trickstar Holly Angel!

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:20.560
I activate the Continuous 
Trap, Trickstar Perennial!

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:23.840
By sending Trickstar Nightshade 
to the graveyard,

00:20:23.840 --> 00:20:27.440
Holly Angel can't be destroyed in battle!

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:31.280
But you still take damage.

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.780
I end my turn.

00:20:56.670 --> 00:20:59.400
The battle is only getting started!

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:03.370
The true terror is yet to come.

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:07.520
You'll feel all of it, Blue Angel.

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:13.860
With her best strategies blocked, 
Blue Angel is in a huge pinch!

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:16.700
But she can make a big comeback next turn!

00:21:16.700 --> 00:21:19.200
Do your best, Blue Angel!

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:22.680
Do your best, Chief Zaizen's sister!

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:27.640
This is bad.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.050
Blue Angel is in a pinch-

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:32.260
Silence!  Be quiet!

00:21:32.260 --> 00:21:33.260
Okaaaaay.

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:36.340
Fine.  I'll cheer.

00:21:58.380 --> 00:21:59.500
What's this?

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:15.010
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:22.150
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:29.350
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:29.580 --> 00:22:36.770
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:44.040
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:44.060 --> 00:22:48.060
There were fragments of power

00:22:48.060 --> 00:22:55.240
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:55.240 --> 00:23:02.480
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:09.780
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:16.890
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:16.890 --> 00:23:23.910
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:24.330 --> 00:23:31.610
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:35.690 --> 00:23:39.740
A miracle refers to a mysterious phenomenon.

00:23:39.930 --> 00:23:44.770
Whether you draw or don't draw the card 
you want only depends on the odds.

00:23:45.050 --> 00:23:47.410
What about Blue Angel?

00:23:47.410 --> 00:23:50.620
She'll grab a miracle with her own hands.

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:53.310
That's her way of doing things.

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:56.110
She's Aoi Zaizen's doctor!

00:23:56.680 --> 00:24:00.980
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Three Draws Leading to Hope

00:24:00.980 --> 00:24:03.220
Into the VRAINS!
